OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Frather windy for most overnight with
OL,7,Fgales around the coasts in Cumbria
OL,8,Fthis evening and some rain over the
OL,9,Fhills, though largely dry. Cloud
OL,10,Fbuilding overnight with rain arriving
OL,11,Facross Cumbria by dawn. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FDry in the south initially
OL,14,Fbut turning cloudier and more
OL,15,Funsettled with a band of rain sinking
OL,16,Facross the region throughout the day.
OL,17,FMild with winds easing by the
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
