OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fand colder on Friday with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand showers. Settled and largely dry
OL,8,Fthereafter with some sunshine and
OL,9,Ffeeling rather chilly, locally frosty
OL,10,Fnights with lighter winds.
